WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:06.878
Telo Ride 1 is one class, nothing else. So the races are gone.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.307
Open any race address, the map list, a race setup, a lobby or the race itself, and

00:00:15.307 --> 00:00:18.160
you get page not found, with the way back.

00:00:23.228 --> 00:00:27.987
Home keeps its greeting and its Classes door. The Race door, the next ride card and

00:00:27.987 --> 00:00:30.408
the Race link in the header are gone.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:41.055
The World stays. It draws the course when you ride the class in Ibiza, so only the

00:00:41.055 --> 00:00:42.315
racing came out.

00:00:49.038 --> 00:00:53.638
An old race link lands softly on every screen, from a phone to a desktop.

00:00:59.361 --> 00:01:04.235
What the tests prove: four race addresses are no screen, every class still rides,

00:01:04.235 --> 00:01:06.461
and the pipeline is green again.

00:01:12.266 --> 00:01:17.920
Telo Ride 1, from the Telo family, is the focused edition of Telo Ride: one class,

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:19.116
nothing else.

00:01:19.461 --> 00:01:24.413
It pairs with a smart bike at home over Bluetooth, plays the class video, or draws

00:01:24.413 --> 00:01:29.425
the Ibiza Sunset Strip course to music if the rider chooses it, and sets the bike's

00:01:29.425 --> 00:01:32.926
resistance for every interval while the rider pedals.

00:01:33.272 --> 00:01:37.247
Connect the bike, take the class, see your number, and come back to beat it.
